{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110524001:1":{"text":"Can you check her over?","source_cn":"快些检查吧……拜托了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x118461DF697A5842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110524002:1":{"text":"Hmm... From her symptoms and the residue on the dagger—","source_cn":"唔……从阿尔萨的症状和匕首上残余毒药的色泽判断——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69846B180376688F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110524003:1":{"text":"It indeed is the specific poison I suspected.","source_cn":"错不了，确实是我想的那种毒药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C4B76D8A5067BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110524004:1":{"text":"Well? Stop being mysterious and just tell us! Can you make an antidote?!","source_cn":"喂！你在将功补过，别卖关子了！你能配出解药吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE92EE7E2B88025EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110524005:1":{"text":"Yes, and no.","source_cn":"能，也不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7282105A540092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1110524005":{"text":"Yes, and no.","source_cn":"能，也不能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A7282105A540092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110524006:1":{"text":"Hey, your eyes are giving off a bit of a scary vibe... So, it's like this:","source_cn":"呃！你们的眼神不要这么恐怖！是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD134460D09CABEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110524007:1":{"text":"I have a formula for the antidote, but we're missing a crucial herb.","source_cn":"解药的配方我大致有头绪，不过缺少了一种关键的草药！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A5FC899A5FB3739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110524008:1":{"text":"The herb is called luminous sandweed, and there's only one place to find it. Can you guess where?","source_cn":"那种草药叫曜砂草，只有一个渠道能搞到，你们猜猜是哪里——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9576091877B54585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110524008":{"text":"The herb is called luminous sandweed, and there's only one place to find it. Can you guess where?","source_cn":"那种草药叫曜砂草，只有一个渠道能搞到，你们猜猜是哪里——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9576091877B54585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110524009:1":{"text":"I didn't mean to sound so mysterious! I've just been telling so many bedtime stories to the kids that it became a habit.","source_cn":"我、我真的不是有意的！唉，都是给孩子们讲太多睡前故事，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2DC4D36708206AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110524010:1":{"text":"I only know one merchant, Benji, who deals with this herb. He can usually be found around the Sunseek Arena.","source_cn":"我只认识一个草药商——班吉能提供这种草药，他平时在残阳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC953FA149DC45FD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110524011:1":{"text":"The Sunseek Arena is so far away! If we take the same detour we did from the Grimmaw camp as we did on the way here, we definitely won't make it in time...","source_cn":"从战歌营帐去残阳武斗场？如果像来的时候那样从黑嚎营地绕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F8449FE7225F55C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110524012:1":{"text":"It's life or death, we can't waste any time. No detours, Soren...","source_cn":"人命关天，片刻都不能耽误。不必绕路了，索恩……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BCD2F333F1F47FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110524013:0":{"text":"Here's a note! You can use this to access the back entrance of the arena.","source_cn":"我会给你们一份手书，让你们可以从武斗场的后门通过！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC49486FBFD7D80A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:17::0":{"text":"Entrance Pass","source_cn":"通行证","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30A7DBB9E6C040D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110524014:1":{"text":"Thank you, Mikola!","source_cn":"曼卡拉……多谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67DF0A250318EC03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110524015:1":{"text":"You should head out. I'll stay here and keep an eye on Alsa.","source_cn":"快出发吧，我跟这个家伙帮你照顾阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F1325F06813153A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110524016:1":{"text":"I'll be back as soon as possible!","source_cn":"拜托了！我会尽快返回的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69141694B12D0B9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110524017:1":{"text":"Take good care of her. If anything happens to her—","source_cn":"好好照顾阿尔萨，如果阿尔萨出了什么问题——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA10E12E44FFFCEAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110524018:1":{"text":"... Huh? How did she suddenly become my responsibility?","source_cn":"诶？怎么就成了我的责任？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9807B5DEC7FD2FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"Just say it!","source_cn":"快说！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D50EC59DC57970B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Just say it!","female":"Just say it!","variant_male_record_index":"63596","variant_female_record_index":"63597","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"... Being cryptic again?","source_cn":"……又卖关子？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7700A6FD8A03A046","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... Being cryptic again?","female":"... Being cryptic again?","variant_male_record_index":"63598","variant_female_record_index":"63599","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"What do you mean by yes?","source_cn":"为什么能？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC330C851A63E8A61","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What do you mean by yes?","female":"What do you mean by yes?","variant_male_record_index":"63592","variant_female_record_index":"63593","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"What do you mean by no?","source_cn":"为什么不能？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE32433B98969CFBA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What do you mean by no?","female":"What do you mean by no?","variant_male_record_index":"63594","variant_female_record_index":"63595","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"Smokey","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"Mikola","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":3}}